      "content": "Hey, I'm working as a casting assistant on a period drama set in the Bronx around 1975. We're trying to get the vibe right for the background scenes. Can you give me some descriptions of the typical 'street-level' inhabitants of the Bronx back then? We want to use these to build out some authentic character archetypes for our extras.",
